    "2e344f1741209a8078677bfb6ce7d66f9a068bd3c28e83add467c753bf247b92": {
      "normalizationVersion": 1,
      "sourceHash": "037373916b990bd65ef48141aa18b89a972800cfd501c3cb45c3533927433981",
      "contextFingerprint": "59fc17ee25671938b0a16b1952268550612b57c1f15d89b87275ea58afdf8f12",
      "sourceText": "| 需求 | 推荐写法 | 原因 |\n|:---|:---|:---|\n| 只读访问每个元素 | 范围 for | 最简洁 |\n| 修改每个元素的值 | `for (auto& x : c)` | 直接改原元素 |\n| 需要下标 | 传统 `for (size_t i = 0; ...)` | 下标是逻辑的一部分 |\n| 比较相邻元素 | 传统 for | 要访问 `i` 和 `i - 1` |\n| 遍历时删除元素 | 迭代器循环 / 算法 | 范围 for 容易触发迭代器失效 |",
      "translatedText": "| Requirement | Recommended form | Reason |\n|:---|:---|:---|\n| Read\\-only access to each element | Range for | Most concise |\n| Modify the value of each element | `for (auto& x : c)` | Directly modify the original element |\n| Need the index | Traditional `for (size_t i = 0; ...)` | The index is part of the logic |\n| Compare adjacent elements | Traditional for | Need to access `i` and `i - 1` |\n| Delete elements during traversal | Iterator loop / algorithm | Range for easily triggers iterator invalidation |",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 201,
        "outputTokens": 88,
        "costUsd": 0.000166
      }
    },
